OL,3,AGermany investigates Russia links to
OL,4,Aweapons cache discovered in woods,
OL,5,Areports say
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhile refusing to confirm reports of
OL,8,FRussian links to the cache, Dobrindt
OL,9,Fsaid he could not rule out "the
OL,10,Finvolvement of foreign powers".
OL,12,FFor months security agencies have
OL,13,Fwarned that Russian intelligence
OL,14,Fservices are planning assassinations in
OL,15,FGermany, possibly targeting defence
OL,16,Findustry executives or opposition
OL,17,Ffigures in exile.
